# Variadic param collects excess positional args into a Dict (integer-keyed).
# Unannotated ...rest collects excess positionals as Dict{0: T0, 1: T1, ...}.
# Typed buckets (...x@T) collect into Seq cons-lists; unannotated rest into Dict.
# Empty variadic = Dict({}); non-empty = Dict({Int(0): val0, Int(1): val1, ...}).
[f: [fn [let _ ...rest] rest]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
["f": [fn [let _ rest] ...]  "result": [20  30]]
